  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">Serena is running a juice shop. Oranges cost $2 per pound. She can spend at most $64 per day on oranges. If \( p \) represents the number of pounds of oranges Serena can buy per day, which of the following inequalities is true?</para>
  </section>
